 t
DESCRIPTION:IEB Grade 12 - Pascal - Access - Other three-term independent s
 chool (ISASA guideline) - T1 W1\n\nProgramming:\n- Pascal 30 (part): The PA
 T - IEB\n    focus: the PAT documents: specification\, design\, and technic
 al and testing\; comments in the project: what each method does\, receives 
 and gives back\n    https://itcoder.co.za/lesson.php?c=pascal&id=lesson27\n
 - Pascal 8 (part): Decisions / Branching\n    focus: complex Boolean expres
 sions and truth tables with 4 variables\n    https://itcoder.co.za/lesson.p
 hp?c=pascal&id=lesson08\n\nTheory:\n- What makes a computer fast\n    https
 ://itcoder.co.za/lesson.php?c=theory12&id=performance\n\nDatabases:\n- SQL 
 3: Keys and relationships\n    focus: keys: primary\, foreign\, composite\;
  relationships one-to-one\, one-to-many\, many-to-many\; referential integr
 ity\n    https://itcoder.co.za/lesson.php?c=sql&id=dbkeys\n- SQL 4: A good 
 design\n    focus: redundancy\, repeating groups\, duplicate and derived da
 ta\, atomic and non-atomic fields\; update\, insert and delete anomalies\n 
    https://itcoder.co.za/lesson.php?c=sql&id=dbdesign
